---
// "Skip to content": the first focusable element on the page (STRUCTURE.md "Global chrome").
---
<a class="skip" href="#content">Skip to content</a>

<style>
  .skip {
    position: fixed;
    top: var(--s2);
    left: var(--s2);
    z-index: 100;
    padding: var(--s3) var(--s4);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--night);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transform: translateY(calc(-100% - var(--s4)));
  }
  .skip:focus-visible {
    transform: none;
  }
</style>
